     "what": "aisi1045 cutting.min_chip_thickness_ratio"
    },
    {
     "note": "0.78 = Albrecht-method estimate from the ETH force data (klippel-2022 Sect. 3.4), which the authors call very high and likely inaccurate because of BUE and segmentation; 0.3-0.6 is the range of Coulomb coefficients used in the FE studies read for other steels; 0.5 chosen",
